            "Adding reversed (1) to (2): 2NO + N₂ + 2O₂ → N₂ + O₂ + 2NO₂, cancelling N₂ (appears both sides) and combining O₂ (2O₂ on left minus 1 O₂ cancelling with right's O₂, net 1 O₂ remaining on left): 2NO + O₂ → 2NO₂.",
